### PayFlow Ledger examples (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
### Mint a dev token: any HS256 JWT signed with JWT_SECRET (default dev-only-secret-change-me-0123456789abcdef)
### carrying a "merchant_id" claim. merchant_id is NEVER read from the request body.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = <paste HS256 JWT with merchant_id claim>
@payer = <payer account uuid>
@payee = <payee account uuid>

### Transfer (first execution -> 201)
POST {{host}}/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-1

{"fromAccountId": "{{payer}}", "toAccountId": "{{payee}}", "amountMinor": 500, "currency": "USD"}

### Idempotent retry: same key, same body -> identical status and body, money moves once
POST {{host}}/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-1

{"fromAccountId": "{{payer}}", "toAccountId": "{{payee}}", "amountMinor": 500, "currency": "USD"}

### Same key, different body -> 422
POST {{host}}/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-transfer-1

{"fromAccountId": "{{payer}}", "toAccountId": "{{payee}}", "amountMinor": 501, "currency": "USD"}

### Create payment
POST {{host}}/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-pay-1

{"payerAccountId": "{{payer}}", "payeeAccountId": "{{payee}}", "amountMinor": 1000, "currency": "USD"}

### Authorize / capture / refund / void (replace the id with the paymentId from the response above)
@paymentId = <payment uuid>

POST {{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/authorize
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-auth-1

###
POST {{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-capture-1

{"amountMinor": 400}

###
POST {{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-refund-1

{"amountMinor": 100}

###
POST {{host}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/void
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-void-1

### Balance
GET {{host}}/v1/accounts/{{payer}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statement, newest first; pass nextCursor from the previous page as cursor
GET {{host}}/v1/accounts/{{payer}}/statement?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
